# Django REST Framework

{{#if parameters.useSerializers}}
- Validate all input through DRF serializers
- Never trust raw request.data without validation
{{/if}}
{{#if parameters.useViewSets}}
- Use ViewSets with routers for CRUD endpoints
{{/if}}
- Keep views thin; business logic in services or models
- Use pagination for list endpoints
- Return consistent error response format
